@startuml
title HIP-1 — the five-step spot deployment
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #EEF5FF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4A78B5
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #F7FAFF
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #4A78B5
skinparam ArrowColor #4A78B5
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F7FAFF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #4A78B5

start
:win the Dutch auction and send
registerToken2 (name, szDecimals, weiDecimals);<<#FFF7E6>>
note right
  ONLY time-sensitive step.
  Gas is charged here, in HYPE,
  and is never refunded.
  31 h linear decay from
  2x the last clearing price
  down to a 500 HYPE floor.
end note
:userGenesis
(userAndWei, existingTokenAndWei, blacklistUsers);
note right: may be sent repeatedly
:genesis
(maxSupply checksum, optional noHyperliquidity);
:registerSpot
(base index, quote index);
if (Hyperliquidity wanted?) then (yes)
  :registerHyperliquidity
  (startPx, orderSz, nOrders, nSeededLevels);
else (no, noHyperliquidity was set)
  :nOrders must be 0;
endif
:token trades on its spot book;
fork
  :setDeployerTradingFeeShare
  (may only ever decrease);
fork again
  :enableQuoteToken
  (200k HYPE, irreversible);
fork again
  :link an ERC-20 on the HyperEVM
  and finalize from the EVM side;
end fork
stop
@enduml
